@startuml DS-03 Tracking
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam noteBorderColor #f39c12
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FEF9E7

title DS-03 : Tracking d'un email de phishing (open → clic → soumission)

actor "Cible (navigateur)" as C
entity "Nginx (proxy)" as N
participant "Backend Tracking" as BE #ffe6cc
database "PostgreSQL" as DB #dae8fc

== ① Open tracking, pixel chargé à l'ouverture de l'email ==

C -> N : GET /px/{token}\n[pixel 1×1 chargé par le client mail]
N -> BE : Proxie la requête
activate BE

BE -> DB : SELECT result WHERE tracking_token = {token}\n[garde applicative : si opened_at IS NULL]\nUPDATE opened_at = now(), status = 'Opened' → commit
activate DB
DB --> BE : OK
deactivate DB

BE -> DB : UPDATE campaign_stats\nopened_count += 1 (read-modify-write) → commit séparé
activate DB
DB --> BE : OK
deactivate DB

BE --> C : 200 OK image/gif (1×1 px transparent)\nCache-Control: no-store
deactivate BE

== ② Click tracking, clic sur le lien dans l'email ==

C -> N : GET /r/{token}\n[clic sur le lien de phishing]
N -> BE : Proxie la requête
activate BE

BE -> DB : SELECT result WHERE tracking_token = {token}\n[garde applicative : si clicked_at IS NULL]\nUPDATE clicked_at = now(), status = 'Clicked' → commit\npuis campaign_stats.clicked_count += 1 (commit séparé)
activate DB
DB --> BE : OK
deactivate DB

BE --> C : 302 Redirect → /secure/{token}
deactivate BE

C -> N : GET /secure/{token}
N -> BE : Proxie la requête
activate BE

BE -> DB : SELECT campaign_result, template\nWHERE tracking_token = {token}
activate DB
DB --> BE : Result + Template HTML
deactivate DB

note over BE
 Remplace les placeholders :
 {{.Email}}, {{.FirstName}}, {{.LastName}},
 {{.Position}}, {{FORM_ACTION}}
end note

BE --> C : 200 OK text/html\n(landing page personnalisée)
deactivate BE

== ③ Soumission credentials ==

C -> N : POST /secure/{token}\n{username, password}
N -> BE : Proxie la requête
activate BE

note over BE
 Aucun credential stocké
 (privacy by design, RGPD Art. 5)
end note

BE -> DB : SELECT result WHERE tracking_token = {token}\n[garde applicative : si submitted_at IS NULL]\nUPDATE submitted_at = now(), status = 'Submitted Data' → commit\npuis campaign_stats.submitted_count += 1 (commit séparé)
activate DB
DB --> BE : OK
deactivate DB

BE --> C : 302 Redirect → {FRONTEND_URL}/caught
deactivate BE

note over C
 Page pédagogique affichée :
 « Oops, You've Been Caught! »
end note

== ④ Report tracking, cible suspecte signale l'email ==

C -> N : GET /report/{token}\n[clic sur "Report this email" dans l'email]
N -> BE : Proxie la requête
activate BE

BE -> DB : SELECT result WHERE tracking_token = {token}\n[garde applicative : si reported_at IS NULL]\nUPDATE reported_at = now(), status = 'Reported' → commit\npuis campaign_stats.reported_count += 1 (commit séparé)
activate DB
DB --> BE : OK
deactivate DB

BE --> C : 302 Redirect → {FRONTEND_URL}/caught?reported=true
deactivate BE

note over C
 Page « Good job, you spotted it! »
 (thème vert, comportement positif)
end note

@enduml
